<!--
  Same-host HTML pages only.

  This file previously listed ~60 URLs including buy.stripe.com, store.3labs.io and
  policy-gate.3labsio.workers.dev. A sitemap may only contain URLs on its own host; crawlers
  discard cross-domain entries and a sitemap that is mostly discarded is a weak trust signal.
  It also listed QR .png files, .uri payment strings and .well-known JSON — machine endpoints
  that are already discoverable via llms.txt, .well-known/ and openapi.json, and that dilute
  the pages actually worth ranking.

  Most importantly it omitted agent-governance-reference.html entirely: our largest piece of
  free, citable content and the page most likely to be found by someone searching for the
  thing we do.
-->
